# Local data caches — TUBA reads species data from paths configured by
# env vars (TUBA_MOUSE_REG_DIR, TUBA_HUMAN_REG_DIR, ...) and the data
# itself is never committed. The defaults below are the locations the
# code falls back to if env vars are unset.
.cache/
data/cache/
